 "remarks": "Tranquility surrounds this remodeled 4-bedroom, 3-bath home offers 3,247 square feet of move-in-ready living on more than two private acres in a sought-after, well-established neighborhood. Set on a quiet cul-de-sac with a circular driveway and no wetlands, the property combines privacy with a setting you can fully enjoy. A sparkling pool anchors the outdoor space, perfect for summer entertaining and relaxed weekends at home. Inside, the flexible finished lower level adapts to your lifestyle as a media room, home gym, playroom, office, or guest space. The family room is the heart of the home, with soaring vaulted ceilings, a skylight, and beautiful double doors that open onto the expansive backyard. Two fireplaces add warmth throughout, refinished floors gleam, and the home is filled with natural light. The primary bath features a heated floor for everyday luxury, and thoughtful extras include central vacuum and a brand-new garage with an epoxy floor. Surrounded by the natural beauty of North Stamford's back country, the home is moments from the Mianus River preserve, with its wooded trails and riverside serenity. Yet it is anything but remote: Pound Ridge's shops and dining are minutes away, and New Canaan, Bedford, Armonk, and downtown Stamford are all within easy reach.",
